{"id": 15241, "stem": "<div class=\"relative w-full min-w-0 max-w-full self-stretch\" id=\"question-text\"><span><p class=\"mb-4 text-start\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 400; font-size: 1rem;\"><mark class=\"bg-transparent dark:text-neutral-100\" data-markjs=\"true\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">A</mark> 75-year-old man is brought to the emergency department after his family found him to be lethargic and confused.\u00a0 The patient has a history of hypertension, coronary artery disease, and heart failure.\u00a0 Temperature is 35 C (95 F), blood pressure is 78/46 mm Hg, and pulse is 110/min.\u00a0 The patient is admitted to the intensive care unit and a pulmonary artery catheter is placed, which demonstrates the following readings:</p><div class=\"group/triggerable\" data-is-open=\"false\"><div class=\"group/draggable\" data-is-draggable=\"true\" data-is-dragging=\"false\"><div class=\"group/resizable relative\" data-is-maximized=\"false\" data-is-resizable=\"true\" data-is-resizing=\"false\"><div class=\"relative max-w-full\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-8 z-10 transition-opacity duration-200 bg-gradient-to-r from-white dark:from-nbme-primary-dark-800 warm:from-egg-sour-50 to-transparent opacity-0\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute right-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-8 z-10 transition-opacity duration-200 bg-gradient-to-l from-white dark:from-nbme-primary-dark-800 warm:from-egg-sour-50 to-transparent opacity-0\"></div><div class=\"max-w-full overflow-x-auto [&amp;_td]:min-w-[8rem] [&amp;_th]:min-w-[8rem]\"><table class=\"border bg-transparent dark:text-white border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white hover:bg-transparent warm:hover:bg-transparent dark:hover:bg-transparent cursor-default mt-2 mb-3\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><tbody style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-original-nbme-400/10 warm:hover:bg-brown-700/10 dark:hover:bg-white/15\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><td class=\"border border-collapse border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white p-1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; font-size: 1rem;\">Cardiac output</td><td class=\"border border-collapse border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white p-1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; font-size: 1rem;\">high</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-original-nbme-400/10 warm:hover:bg-brown-700/10 dark:hover:bg-white/15\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><td class=\"border border-collapse border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white p-1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; font-size: 1rem;\">Central venous pressure</td><td class=\"border border-collapse border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white p-1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; font-size: 1rem;\">low</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-original-nbme-400/10 warm:hover:bg-brown-700/10 dark:hover:bg-white/15\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><td class=\"border border-collapse border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white p-1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; font-size: 1rem;\">Pulmonary capillary wedge pressure</td><td class=\"border border-collapse border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white p-1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; font-size: 1rem;\">low</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-original-nbme-400/10 warm:hover:bg-brown-700/10 dark:hover:bg-white/15\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><td class=\"border border-collapse border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white p-1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; font-size: 1rem;\">Mixed venous O<sub style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">2</sub> saturation</td><td class=\"border border-collapse border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white p-1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; font-size: 1rem;\">high</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-original-nbme-400/10 warm:hover:bg-brown-700/10 dark:hover:bg-white/15\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><td class=\"border border-collapse border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white p-1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; font-size: 1rem;\">Systemic vascular resistance</td><td class=\"border border-collapse border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white p-1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; font-size: 1rem;\">low</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-4 text-start\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 400; font-size: 1rem;\">Which of the following is the most likely cause of this patient's hypotension?\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b</p></span></div>", "options": [{"label": "A", "text": "Bacterial infection"}, {"label": "B", "text": "Gastrointestinal bleeding"}, {"label": "C", "text": "Heart failure"}, {"label": "D", "text": "Hypothermia"}, {"label": "E", "text": "Myocardial infarction"}, {"label": "F", "text": "Pulmonary embolism"}], "correctAnswer": "A", "explanation": "<div class=\"relative w-full min-w-0 max-w-full self-stretch\" id=\"question-explanation\"><span class=\"\"><div id=\"div_t40474\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><div class=\"group/triggerable\" data-is-open=\"false\"><div class=\"group/draggable\" data-is-draggable=\"true\" data-is-dragging=\"false\"><div class=\"group/resizable relative\" data-is-maximized=\"false\" data-is-resizable=\"true\" data-is-resizing=\"false\"><div class=\"relative max-w-full\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-8 z-10 transition-opacity duration-200 bg-gradient-to-r from-white dark:from-nbme-primary-dark-800 warm:from-egg-sour-50 to-transparent opacity-0\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute right-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-8 z-10 transition-opacity duration-200 bg-gradient-to-l from-white dark:from-nbme-primary-dark-800 warm:from-egg-sour-50 to-transparent opacity-0\"></div><div class=\"max-w-full overflow-x-auto [&amp;_td]:min-w-[8rem] [&amp;_th]:min-w-[8rem]\"><table class=\"border bg-transparent dark:text-white border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white hover:bg-transparent warm:hover:bg-transparent dark:hover:bg-transparent cursor-default mt-2 mb-3\" styl